    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109325" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποταμνόν</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a plant cut off at bottom</i>
